i.github.com/users/fe-art/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fe-art/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":16575341,"digest":"sha256:8d279168e5a7daaa3beb21b1ea1adbb7f0552ceacbdfa45ba778cc9a96298295","download_count":8719,"created_at":"2026-11-05T10:56:45Z","updated_at":"2026-11-05T10:56:46Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/jojoe77777/Toolscreen/releases/download/v1.5.2/Toolscreen-1.5.2-double-click-me.jar"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojoe77777/Toolscreen/tarball/v1.5.2","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojoe77777/Toolscreen/zipball/v1.5.2","body":"﻿Toolscreen 1.5.2 is now available!\r\n\r\n## New Features\r\n- Better support for Minecraft 26.x, including Vulkan\r\n- Support for ARM64 Windows\r\n- Better interactive UI for creating mirrors\r\n- Configurable startup indicator icon\r\n- Options for background image fill (e.g fill/fit/stretch)\r\n- Rebind indicator now supports GIFs\r\n- Overwolf is prevented from injecting into Minecraft when using Toolscreen\r\n## Changes\r\n- Config files are less likely to become corrupted\r\n- Fast key repeat rate is less likely to cause lag\r\n## Bug Fixes\r\n- Fixed \"Sources\" missing in Wide mode\r\n- Fixed some issues related to game freeze on startup\r\n- Fixed Backspace and Delete not being usable as hotkeys\r\n- Better support for non-ASCII characters in keyboard layout\r\n- Fixed Images/GIFs not loading from non-English folder paths\r\n- Fixed key repeat rate and mouse speed not applying when the game started in the background\r\n- Fixed blind results not showing on nbb overlay without boat state\r\n- Fixed some NinjabrainBot overlay sliders resetting after restart\r\n- Fixed duplicate \"%\" in X/Y scaling labels\r\n- Potential fix for mirror group scaling (should not break existing mirrors/groups, and this fix may not work)\r\n\r\n**How to update: Download the .jar below (or the .exe if your browser blocks the .jar), put it in the instance folder, and double click it**\r\n\r\nReport bugs and suggestions in the Discord: https://discord.gg/A2v6bCJg6K\r\n\r\n## Patreon\r\nIf you would like to support the future development of Toolscreen, you can [subscribe through Patreon](https://www.patreon.com/jojoe77777), your name will show up in the Supporters tab of Toolscreen and you get access to exclusive supporter discord channels\r\n"}